---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <p>
        I'm Madhurjya, a backend and platform engineer with 7+ years of
        experience building distributed systems, event-driven architectures, and
        cloud-native infrastructure.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work with Go, Python, Java, Kotlin, Lua, TypeScript, and JavaScript,
        and I care a lot about Linux, Kubernetes, developer tooling, clean
        abstractions, and systems that stay simple under pressure.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside work, I'm usually tinkering with electronics, building my
        homelab, automating bits of my home with IoT projects, learning
        languages, traveling, listening to rock music, or thinking about cars
        and bikes.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
